5,0,1,talk,Asuka,,I believe we should prioritize logical consistency over intuition. I will be observing everyone's claims and how they evolve. Let's focus on identifying contradictions in our statements to uncover the werewolf.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,May,,"Logic is all well and good, Asuka, but this game is about people, not just puzzles. I'll be watching for those little slips in emotion and tone. Let's keep it lively, shall we?","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Rin,,"Ooh, this sounds like a big adventure! I'm so excited! I think we should just follow whoever seems the coolest and most confident. That's how you find the leader, right? Let's make this fun!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Minako,,"I agree with Asuka. While May's focus on emotion has some merit, factual consistency is the most reliable metric. I will be observing how each of you supports your claims as the game progresses.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Shion,,"Logic is the only reliable tool here. I'll be observing your patterns and contradictions from a distance. If you want to survive, I suggest you keep your stories consistent. I'm interested to see who cracks first.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Rin, following confidence is a dangerous strategy; the werewolf is often the most confident liar. We must rely on verifiable information. @May, while emotions can be clues, they are easily faked. Let's stick to the facts.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,May,,"@Asuka, you're so serious! That's exactly why you're easy to read. If we only stick to ""facts,"" we'll miss the subtle dance of deception. A little intuition makes the game much more exciting, don't you think?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, you're being a party pooper! But @May is right, the ""dance"" part sounds way more exciting! I want to see who's the best at pretending. Maybe the coolest person is just the best at the game!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Minako,,"@Rin, excitement is fine, but remember that the goal is to protect the village. @May, intuition can be a starting point, but it must be verified by evidence. Let's ensure we don't let emotion cloud our judgment.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Shion,,"@Rin, your approach is naive. Confidence is a mask, not a guide. @May, intuition is just a fancy word for guessing. I'll be the one filtering your ""dances"" through a lens of cold logic.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Asuka,,"It seems we are largely in agreement on the importance of logic, despite Rin and May's preferences. I will be paying close attention to any shifts in behavior or sudden changes in stance as the days progress.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,May,,"@Asuka, you're so focused on ""shifts"" that you might miss what's right in front of you. I'll be watching everyone's reactions too—it's always the ones trying too hard to be logical who have something to hide.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Rin,,"@May, that's a great point! Maybe the people acting all ""serious"" are actually the bad guys! That makes it like a spy movie! I'm going to watch everyone's faces really closely!","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Minako,,"@Rin, while watching faces is a start, remember that a skilled liar can maintain a mask. We should focus on the consistency of the information provided. If a claim changes without a logical reason, that is our strongest lead.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Shion,,"@Minako, you're correct. A mask is only effective until it contradicts a previously established fact. I'll be cataloging every claim made. Any deviation from the original narrative will be treated as a confession of guilt.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Asuka,,"Since we have established our general approaches, let us proceed. I will be analyzing the data gathered from the first night with a critical eye. I expect everyone to be precise with their words from tomorrow onward.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,May,,"Precision is so boring, Asuka. I'll be keeping things a bit more flexible. Let's see who actually manages to keep their story straight when the pressure is on. Good luck to everyone!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
