23,0,4,talk,Rin,,"I'm ready for the first night! I hope something super exciting happens! I'll be watching everyone's faces tomorrow to see who's acting like a spy! Good luck, everyone!","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over!""}]}"
