25,0,4,talk,Minako,,I believe we have a clear understanding of our respective methods. I will remain focused on the facts and the stability of our claims. Let us see what the first night reveals.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
