27,0,4,talk,Shion,,"The stage is set. I've noted your tendencies and your philosophies. Now, let's see if your ""intuition"" or ""excitement"" can survive the weight of a logical contradiction. I'll be waiting.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
