35,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"The first night has passed. I have gathered my initial information. Now, I want to see how everyone reacts to the start of the first day. Please share any observations or suspicions you may have.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,1,talk,May,,"@Asuka, you're jumping straight into the interrogation! How clinical. I'm feeling quite relaxed, but I wonder if some of our ""logical"" friends are feeling a bit too tense now that the game has actually started?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,Rin,,"@May is right! Everyone is acting so serious all of a sudden! @Asuka, you're like a teacher giving a test! Is anyone else feeling nervous? I bet the werewolf is the one acting the most ""clinical""!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""May"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,1,talk,Minako,,"@Rin, nervousness is a natural reaction, but it isn't evidence. @May, being relaxed is also not a proof of innocence. Let's avoid guessing based on mood and instead focus on any concrete information we can gather.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,1,talk,Shion,,"@Rin, your theory is as shallow as your approach. @May, your attempt to deflect by labeling us ""tense"" is a common tactic to avoid scrutiny. Let's stop the chatter. Does anyone actually have a lead, or are we just playing house?","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Shion, your impatience is noted, but rushing leads to errors. Since no one has come forward with a claim, I'll ask: does anyone here feel they have a role that allows them to provide concrete information?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,May,,"@Asuka, always so eager to push people into a corner. If someone has a secret, they'll reveal it when they feel it's strategic. Why the rush? Are you trying to force a mistake, or just hiding your own nerves?","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@May, you're so cool! You're like a detective in a movie! @Asuka, why are you being so pushy? It's making me think you're the one who's nervous! Maybe you're the werewolf and you're scared!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""May"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,2,talk,Minako,,"@Rin, please refrain from making accusations based on personality. @Asuka is simply trying to establish a framework for the discussion. @May, while strategy is important, delaying information can sometimes be seen as suspicious. Does anyone have a lead?","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Asuka"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Minako, you're too lenient. @Asuka's pushiness is a tool, but @May's vague ""strategy"" is a shield. If a Seer exists and is silent, they're either cautious or non-existent. I'm watching for who benefits most from this silence.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Asuka"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"@May, @Rin, your attempts to frame my methodology as ""nervousness"" are illogical. I am simply seeking efficiency. @Shion, you mentioned the Seer's silence. I am the Seer, and I can confirm that Shion is human.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""May"",""Rin"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,May,,"@Asuka, coming out as the Seer so early? How bold! Or perhaps a bit desperate to gain trust? @Shion, you're lucky to be ""cleared,"" but let's see if Asuka's logic holds up as the bodies start to drop.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, you're the Seer?! That's so cool! It's like you have a superpower! @Shion, you're a good guy then! I'm going to trust Asuka because she's being so brave and telling us everything!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,3,talk,Minako,,"@Asuka, revealing your role this early is a significant risk, but it provides us with a concrete starting point. @Shion, since you are confirmed human, I expect you to help us analyze the remaining players with your logic.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,3,talk,Shion,,"@Asuka, a bold move. By revealing yourself, you've either given us a powerful tool or provided the werewolf with a clear target. @Minako, I will do my part. Since I am human, the focus now shifts to May, Rin, and Minako.","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Minako"",""May"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Asuka,,"@Shion, exactly. The focus is now on the remaining three. @May, your skepticism is expected, but my result is a fact. @Rin, @Minako, let us analyze the behavior of May and Rin more closely before we vote.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""May"",""Rin"",""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,May,,"@Asuka, you're so eager to point fingers now that you've put yourself on a pedestal. @Shion, don't get too comfortable; a ""fact"" is only as good as the person reporting it. Who's really the suspicious one here?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,1,4,talk,Rin,,"@May, you're still being a little bit mean to @Asuka! She told us the truth and it's super helpful! I think @May is the one acting suspicious by trying to make us doubt the Seer! I'm voting for May!","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""May"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,1,4,talk,Minako,,"@Rin, let's not rush into a vote based on emotion. @May, your constant attempts to undermine the Seer's credibility without providing any counter-evidence are indeed concerning. If Asuka is the Seer, your behavior is highly suspicious.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""May"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,1,4,talk,Shion,,"@May, your defense is purely reactive. You've offered nothing but vague skepticism and attempts to destabilize the Seer's claim. In a logical framework, the one obstructing the flow of information is the most likely culprit. I'm voting for May.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
